期。元帝為安東將軍，以邵為長史，王導為司馬，二人相與為深交。徵為太子中庶子，復轉散騎常侍，使持節、都督揚州江西淮北諸軍事、東中郎將，隨越出項，而卒於軍中。及王導為司空，既拜，歎曰：「裴道期、劉王喬在，吾不得獨登此位。」導子仲豫與康同字，導思舊好，乃改為敬豫焉。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"盾","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BBA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"邵","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BBB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"道期","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BBB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"元帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"邵","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BBB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"王導","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"二人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"王導","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0097","start":97,"end":100,"surface":"裴道期","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BBB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0101","start":101,"end":104,"surface":"劉王喬","kind":"person","person_id":"2q2_2mj_zv3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0106","start":106,"end":107,"surface":"吾","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0115","start":115,"end":116,"surface":"導","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"仲豫","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0120","start":120,"end":121,"surface":"康","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0124","start":124,"end":125,"surface":"導","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p017:m0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"敬豫","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAC","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":109,"last_line":109,"revision_id":2506399,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peikai-ws2506399"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009","text":"《文章敘錄》曰：秀字季彥。弘通博濟，八歲能屬文，遂知名。大將軍曹爽辟。喪父服終，推財與兄弟。年二十五，遷黃門侍郎。爽誅，以故吏免。遷衛國相，累遷散騎常侍、尚書僕射令、光祿大夫。咸熙中，晉文王始建五等，命秀典爲制度，封廣川侯。晉室受禪，進左光祿大夫，改封钜鹿公，遷司空。著易及樂論，又畫地域圖十八篇，傳行於世。盟會圖及典治官制皆未成。年四十八，泰始七年薨，諡元公，配食宗廟。少子頠，字逸民，襲封。荀綽《冀州記》曰：頠爲人弘雅有遠識，博學稽古，履行高整，自少知名。歷位太子中庶子、侍中尚書。元康末，爲尚書左僕射。趙王倫以其望重，畏而惡之，知其不與賈氏同心，猶被枉害。臣松之案陸機《惠帝起居注》稱「頠雅有遠量，當朝名士也」，又曰「民之望也」。頠理具淵博，贍於論難，著崇有、貴無二論，以矯虛誕之弊，文辭精富，爲世名論。子嵩，字道文。荀綽稱嵩有父祖風。爲中書郎，早卒。頠從父弟邈，字景聲，有雋才，爲太傅司馬越從事中郎，假節監中外營諸軍事。潛少弟徽，字文季，冀州刺史。有高才遠度，善言玄妙。事見荀粲、傅嘏、王弼、管輅諸傳。徽長子黎，字伯宗，一名演，遊擊將軍。次康，字仲豫，太子左衛率。次楷，字叔則，侍中中書令、光祿大夫、開府。次綽，字季舒，黃門侍郎，早卒，追贈長水校尉。康、楷、綽皆爲名士，而楷才望最重。《晉諸公贊》曰：康有弘量，綽以明達爲稱，楷少與琅邪王戎俱爲掾發名，鍾會致之大將軍司馬文王曰：「裴楷清通，王戎簡要。」文王即辟爲掾，進歷顯位。謝鯤爲樂廣傳，稱楷雋朗有識具，當時獨步。黎子苞，秦州刺史。康子純，黃門侍郎。次盾，徐州刺史。次郃，有器望。晉元帝爲安東將軍，郃爲長史，侍中王曠與司馬越書曰：「裴郃在此，雖不治事，然識量弘淹，此下人士大敬附之。」次廓，中壘將軍。楷子瓚，中書郎。次憲，豫州刺史。綽子遐，太傅主簿。瓚、遐並有盛名，早卒。《晉諸公贊》稱憲有清識。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0000","start":0,"end":6,"surface":"《文章敘錄》","kind":"work","person_id":null,"status":"source_explicit","interpretation_note":"文章敘錄原題，作者未署。 原文、MID與字位不變；不拆題中人名。","work_id":"w-sgz023-reference-wenzhangxulu"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"秀","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及既有具名近系原錨交讀；印本未知、未圖校，非人工覆核。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"季彥","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及既有具名近系原錨交讀；印本未知、未圖校，非人工覆核。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"曹爽","kind":"person","person_id":"30k_jzz_tpd_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"爽","kind":"person","person_id":"30k_jzz_tpd_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0092","start":92,"end":95,"surface":"晉文王","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAI","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0101","start":101,"end":102,"surface":"秀","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及既有具名近系原錨交讀；印本未知、未圖校，非人工覆核。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0135","start":135,"end":139,"surface":"易及樂論","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"此處屬事見諸傳／所著論題或傳題，不重複作人物姓名；具體作品回指待分項核。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0188","start":188,"end":189,"s